    "height": 10,
    "size": 8
  },
  {
    "page": 3,
    "text": "THE DEMANDS BEHIND THE WORK",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 63,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 10.920000000000002,
    "size": 8.4
  },
  {
    "page": 3,
    "text": "Train for the moment\nthe game asks more.",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 88,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 76.44,
    "size": 39
  },
  {
    "page": 3,
    "text": "Cricket can give you time to wait. It does not always give you time to prepare.",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 383,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 44,
    "size": 17
  },
  {
    "page": 3,
    "text": "The next ball can ask for a sharp acceleration, a hard throw, force through a shot or another demanding effort late in the day. Physical preparation has to make sense in that world.",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 442,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 51,
    "size": 12.5
  },
  {
    "page": 3,
    "text": "This guide opens a window into the CAIRNOX approach: three early-off-season sessions connecting upper-body strength, lower-body strength and whole-body power with conditioning and speed development.",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 504,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 51,
    "size": 12.5
  },
  {
    "page": 3,
    "text": "Use the week to understand the structure, ask better questions and record the work. A single week is an introduction to the process. Development continues beyond these pages.",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 566,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 51,
    "size": 12.5
  },
  {
    "page": 4,
    "text": "CAIRNOX / FIELD NOTES",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 20,
    "width": 140,
    "height": 10.4,
    "size": 8
  },
  {
    "page": 4,
