    "width": 36,
    "height": 10,
    "size": 8
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "THE CAIRNOX APPROACH",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 63,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 10.920000000000002,
    "size": 8.4
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "Every exercise needs a job.",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 88,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 24,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "Train movements,\nnot muscles.",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 141,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 92.12,
    "size": 47
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "01",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 281,
    "width": 30,
    "height": 13.0,
    "size": 10
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "Train the quality",
    "x": 78,
    "top": 278,
    "width": 372,
    "height": 26,
    "size": 22
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "Start with what the work is intended to develop. Exercise variety is useful when it serves that purpose; it is not an objective of its own.",
    "x": 78,
    "top": 316,
    "width": 365,
    "height": 54,
    "size": 12.5
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "02",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 404,
    "width": 30,
    "height": 13.0,
    "size": 10
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "Respect the sport",
    "x": 78,
    "top": 401,
    "width": 372,
    "height": 26,
    "size": 22
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "The gym shares the week with batting, bowling, fielding, practice, matches and travel. A programme has to sit inside that wider picture.",
    "x": 78,
    "top": 439,
    "width": 365,
    "height": 54,
    "size": 12.5
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "03",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 527,
    "width": 30,
    "height": 13.0,
    "size": 10
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "Build the system",
    "x": 78,
    "top": 524,
    "width": 372,
    "height": 26,
    "size": 22
  },
  {
    "page": 5,
    "text": "A clear session is one layer. Repeated work, recovery and adjustment connect the layers. That is where the longer development process begins.",
    "x": 78,
    "top": 562,
    "width": 365,
    "height": 54,
    "size": 12.5
  },
