    "height": 10,
    "size": 8
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "READ THE PLAN",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 63,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 10.920000000000002,
    "size": 8.4
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "Understand the brief.\nThen begin.",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 88,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 76.44,
    "size": 39
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "Read each complete session before starting. MB means medicine ball; DB means dumbbell. Each day includes a warm-up note, gym work and conditioning or speed.",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 185,
    "width": 420,
    "height": 51,
    "size": 12.5
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "01",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 257,
    "width": 30,
    "height": 12.35,
    "size": 9.5
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "Strength: leave 1-2 reps in reserve",
    "x": 76,
    "top": 255,
    "width": 374,
    "height": 19,
    "size": 15
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "Choose a load you could lift for 1-2 more reps, but not more than that. This is reps in reserve (RIR), used primarily for the strength work. No percentage loads are prescribed.",
    "x": 76,
    "top": 281,
    "width": 374,
    "height": 48,
    "size": 11.5
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "02",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 356,
    "width": 30,
    "height": 12.35,
    "size": 9.5
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "Power: velocity is the goal",
    "x": 76,
    "top": 354,
    "width": 374,
    "height": 19,
    "size": 15
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "Perform throws, jumps and jerks with maximal intensity and light-to-moderate weight. The priority is velocity, not applying the strength-work RIR target.",
    "x": 76,
    "top": 380,
    "width": 374,
    "height": 48,
    "size": 11.5
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "03",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 455,
    "width": 30,
    "height": 12.35,
    "size": 9.5
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "Follow the numbered groups",
    "x": 76,
    "top": 453,
    "width": 374,
    "height": 19,
    "size": 15
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "1A and 1B are paired as a superset. Day 3 ends with the three-exercise group 3A / 3B / 3C. Rest 30-45 seconds between exercises and 1-2 minutes between sets.",
    "x": 76,
    "top": 479,
    "width": 374,
    "height": 48,
    "size": 11.5
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "04",
    "x": 30,
    "top": 554,
    "width": 30,
    "height": 12.35,
    "size": 9.5
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "Fit the speed work around the day",
    "x": 76,
    "top": 552,
    "width": 374,
    "height": 19,
    "size": 15
  },
  {
    "page": 7,
    "text": "Speed can be separate from the gym, attached to cricket training or done together; ideally on the same day. Walk back or rest 1 minute between reps; rest 3-5 minutes between sets.",
    "x": 76,
    "top": 578,
    "width": 374,
    "height": 48,
    "size": 11.5
  },
